   "data": {
    "text": "FOCUS\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 4, CC 17 to 26\n   1 Focus width\n   2 Focus shift\n   3 Narrow focus to Wide focus\n   4 Distraction\n   5 Fixation\n   6 suite: Tunnel vision\n   7 suite: Looks away at the wrong moment\n   8 pair: When a fixation tightens, the shots get closer\n   9 pair: When a distraction pulls hard, something is missed\n  10 pairs: Eyes on one thing"
   },
